WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,720
Help, help me, it belongs to me, I really don’t want to!

2
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:23,520
Do we think Gengen is still alive today?

3
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:25,960
The human cub is the most annoying!

4
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:28,360
Man, the cat’s name is Sangbiao!

5
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:32,280
Sangbiao, it’s such a powerful name!

6
00:00:32,280 --> 00:00:34,480
Humans, can you understand cats talking?

7
00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:36,360
Sangbiao, are you hungry?

8
00:00:36,360 --> 00:00:37,640
Here, here you go!

9
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:41,560
Hum, this cat will not eat such pure and natural food!

10
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:48,557
But you are drooling

11
00:00:48,557 --> 00:00:52,930
It's going to hurt!
